WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:09.033
Ringo turned to Diva.

2
00:00:09.034 --> 00:00:11.701
He told her his idea.

3
00:00:11.702 --> 00:00:16.224
Donny frowned but Diva smiled.

4
00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:21.406
"I love it!" she said.

5
00:00:21.407 --> 00:00:32.243
Soon the lights went dim.

6
00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:42.151
Diva stepped onstage in a sparkling gown.

7
00:00:42.152 --> 00:00:46.359
"I have big news," she said.

8
00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:51.289
"Now all my fans can watch my concert."

9
00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:55.138
"Huh?" Everyone was confused.

10
00:00:55.139 --> 00:01:08.773
"My concert will be on SpaceTube!"

11
00:01:08.774 --> 00:01:20.286
Soon the concert was playing on every planet.

12
00:01:20.287 --> 00:01:29.486
Diva's beautiful music filled space.

13
00:01:29.487 --> 00:01:33.614
After the concert Diva thanked Ringo.

14
00:01:33.615 --> 00:01:35.961
"You're smart.

15
00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:45.946
And you kept me safe!"

16
00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:51.095
Ringo and Bot went to Captain Nova's office.

17
00:01:51.096 --> 00:01:54.647
Lucy was already there.

18
00:01:54.648 --> 00:01:59.563
"Great job, Ringo," Captain Nova said.

19
00:01:59.564 --> 00:02:02.931
"You kept Diva safe."

20
00:02:02.932 --> 00:02:09.530
Ringo grinned. "That's what Diva said.

21
00:02:09.531 --> 00:02:12.956
Oh, and she gave me a gift."

22
00:02:12.957 --> 00:02:16.571
Lucy frowned. "A gift?"

23
00:02:16.572 --> 00:02:19.360
"Yes," Ringo said.

24
00:02:19.361 --> 00:02:23.322
"A ticket to her next show."

25
00:02:23.323 --> 00:02:31.195
"What?" Lucy stomped her foot.

26
00:02:31.196 --> 00:02:33.863
"But I got the kidnapper.

27
00:02:33.864 --> 00:02:38.717
And I'm Diva's biggest fan!"

28
00:02:38.718 --> 00:02:42.258
"Oops." Ringo grinned.

29
00:02:42.259 --> 00:02:45.722
"She gave me two tickets.

30
00:02:45.723 --> 00:02:55.921
One for me. And one for you, Lucy!"

